# Line endings.
#
# This repo is developed on Windows and reviewed on Linux (inside Docker).
# Without this file, Git on Windows can commit CRLF into shell scripts, and a
# .sh file with CRLF fails on Linux with a confusing "bad interpreter" error.
# Normalise text in the repository, and force LF for anything a Linux shell or
# Docker will execute.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh        text eol=lf
*.py        text eol=lf
*.yml       text eol=lf
*.yaml      text eol=lf
*.md        text eol=lf
*.json      text eol=lf
*.ini       text eol=lf
Dockerfile  text eol=lf
.env.example text eol=lf
